<title>INDIA: India gold, silver down on world prices.</title>
<headline>India gold, silver down on world prices.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian gold and silver prices fell on Friday undermined by sliding global prices, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said the prices were also hit by higher supplies and low physical enquiries.</p>
<p>Prices of gold biscuits (116.50 gramme) fell by 250 rupees to 59,700 rupees per piece.  </p>
